  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Quick Start",
      "id": "quick-start",
      "intro": "Mulai menggunakan Scenario Studio Canvas dalam beberapa langkah cepat. Panduan ini akan memandu Anda membuat dan men-submit rule deteksi fraud pertama dalam 5 langkah.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Navigate to Scenario Studio",
          "desc": "Dari sidebar utama aplikasi, klik menu Scenario Management untuk membuka daftar semua scenario yang ada. {previewHtml:1} Di halaman ini Anda dapat melihat status, tipe, dan metrik dari setiap rule yang sudah dibuat.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#fff);border:1px solid #e2e8f0;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z\"/><polyline points=\"9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Scenario Management</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(34,197,94,0.15);\"></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:500;color:#0f172a;flex:1;\">High Value Transfer</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a;font-weight:600;\">Active</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">GENERAL</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(245,158,11,0.15);\"></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:500;color:#0f172a;flex:1;\">Velocity Check</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:6px;background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;font-weight:600;\">Draft</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">CONDITION</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px rgba(34,197,94,0.15);\"></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:500;color:#0f172a;flex:1;\">Geo Anomaly</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:6px;background:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a;font-weight:600;\">Active</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#64748b;\">GENERAL</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Click Add New & Choose Rule Type",
          "desc": "Klik tombol \"Add New\" untuk memulai scenario baru. Pilih tipe rule: GENERAL untuk aturan sederhana (3 langkah) atau CONDITION untuk aturan dengan attribute binding (4 langkah). {previewHtml:1} Untuk quick start ini, pilih GENERAL.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;display:flex;gap:6px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:2px solid #f59e0b;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffbeb,#fff);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(245,158,11,0.12);\"><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">GENERAL</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75);\">3 langkah</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:500;\">Configure Parameters</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Build Flow</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Review &amp; Submit</span></div></div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#e2e8f0,#f1f5f9);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">CONDITION</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;\">4 langkah</span></div><div style=\"padding:7px 10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#94a3b8\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Configure Parameters</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#9ca3af;\">Build Flow</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#9ca3af;\">Use Condition</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#9ca3af;\">Review &amp; Submit</span></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Fill Step 1 \u2014 Basic Parameters",
          "desc": "Lengkapi semua field wajib di Step 1: Rule Name (nama spesifik seperti \"Transaksi Mencolok\"), Description (penjelasan logika deteksi), Risk Score (0-100), Priority (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW), dan Active Period (jadwal aktif rule). {previewHtml:1} Atur juga Cycle Indicator jika perlu pembatasan jam/hari.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;overflow:hidden;\"><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eef2ff,#fff);border-bottom:1px solid #c7d2fe;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Form Parameters</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;color:#6366f1;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\">Step 1/3</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;min-width:66px;\">Rule Name</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:500;\">Transaksi Mencolok</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M6 12l4 4 8-8\"/></svg></span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;min-width:66px;\">Risk Score</span><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"width:50px;height:4px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#22c55e,#f59e0b,#ef4444);position:relative;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;right:10px;top:-2px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#ef4444;border:2px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\"></div></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;\">85</span></div><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;\">HIGH</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;min-width:66px;\">Priority</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;\">HIGH</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;\">MEDIUM / LOW</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M6 12l4 4 8-8\"/></svg></span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;min-width:66px;\">Active Period</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:500;\">00:00 &ndash; 23:59</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M6 12l4 4 8-8\"/></svg></span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc,#fff);border:1px dashed #cbd5e1;\"><span style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#94a3b8;min-width:66px;\">Cycle Indicator</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;font-style:italic;\">Tidak diatur (opsional)</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Build Detection Flow on Canvas",
          "desc": "Lanjut ke Step 2 (Build Flow). Seret node kondisi dari sidebar kiri ke canvas. Hubungkan node dengan menarik dari handle output (lingkaran) ke handle input node lain. {previewHtml:1} Atur parameter setiap kondisi sesuai kebutuhan deteksi. Gunakan Auto-arrange untuk merapikan layout otomatis.",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8fafc 0%,#f1f5f9 100%);border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;position:relative;min-height:130px;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:radial-gradient(#cbd5e1 0.4px,transparent 0.4px);background-size:12px 12px;\"></div><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:1;display:flex;height:130px;\"><div style=\"width:56px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);backdrop-filter:blur(4px);border-right:1px solid rgba(226,232,240,0.7);padding:6px;flex-shrink:0;\"><div style=\"font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:4px;\">Kondisi</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(99,102,241,0.1);color:#6366f1;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1px;\">LOGICAL</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.08);color:#059669;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:1px;\">CONTAINS</div><div style=\"font-size:6px;padding:2px 3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.08);color:#d97706;font-weight:600;\">CONSTANT</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;padding:8px;position:relative;\"><div style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(99,102,241,0.2),rgba(99,102,241,0.08));border:1.5px solid #6366f1;\"><svg width=\"9\" height=\"9\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#6366f1\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:800;color:#4338ca;\">START</span></div><div style=\"margin:4px 0 4px 6px;width:2px;height:18px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#6366f1,#8b5cf6);\"></div><div style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #8b5cf6;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(139,92,246,0.1);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;margin-bottom:2px;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;\">LOGICAL</span></div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#475569;\">Amount &gt; 10jt AND New Merchant</div></div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 80px;width:2px;height:14px;background:#8b5cf6;\"></div><div style=\"display:inline-block;padding:5px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(245,158,11,0.1);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;margin-bottom:2px;\"><div style=\"width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"7\" height=\"7\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"><path d=\"M21 4H3a1 1 0 00-1 1v14a1 1 0 001 1h18a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-1-1z\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">CONTAINS</span></div><div style=\"font-size:7px;color:#475569;\">Merchant Name matches pattern</div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Review & Submit",
          "desc": "Lanjut ke Step 4 (Review & Submit). Periksa ringkasan konfigurasi rule {previewHtml:1} — nama, tipe, parameter, dan diagram canvas. Klik \"Submit Scenario\", isi komentar untuk audit trail, dan konfirmasi. Rule akan tersimpan dan muncul di daftar Scenario Management dengan status aktif.",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
